#: includes/Migration/AdminPage.php:105
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%1$s non-empty field-post values were found across %2$s unique post IDs. "
"This is not a confirmed Series-usage count: ACF-saved defaults are included, "
"while exact empty strings are excluded. WP Title Layer never imports these "
"five fields automatically. If you know they were unused, they do not block "
"subtitle migration; inspect unrelated ACF fields separately before "
"uninstalling ACF."
msgstr ""
"在 %2$s 个不重复的文章 ID 中，共发现 %1$s 个非空的字段—文章值。这并不是已确认"
"的系列使用量：其中包含 ACF 保存的默认值，但不包含严格意义上的空字符串。WP "
"Title Layer 绝不会自动导入这五个字段。如果您确定从未使用过它们，它们不会阻碍"
"副标题迁移；卸载 ACF 前仍应另行检查其他 ACF 字段。"

#. translators: 1: non-empty field-post values, 2: unique posts.
#: includes/Admin/ControlCenter.php:1040
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%1$s non-empty old ACF field values across %2$s post IDs can include "
"defaults and are not confirmed Series use."
msgstr ""
"%2$s 个文章 ID 中共有 %1$s 个非空的旧 ACF 字段值；其中可能包含默认值，不能据"
"此确认系列功能曾被使用。"

#. translators: 1: theme adapter, 2: content type labels.
#: includes/Admin/ControlCenter.php:320
#, php-format
msgid ""
